config IPI_MONITOR
	tristate "IPI Monitor Driver"
	depends on ARM64 && SMP
	default m
	help
	  This driver provides per-core health monitoring based on
	  IPI (Inter-Processor Interrupt) round-robin heartbeat.

	  A monitor kernel thread bound to a configurable CPU periodically
	  sends asynchronous IPIs to all other online CPUs. Each target CPU
	  increments its own heartbeat counter in the IPI callback. The
	  monitor thread detects stalled or unresponsive cores by checking
	  whether the counters keep advancing.

	  Say M to build this as a loadable kernel module.
